      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Any downvote ratings can and will be exploited. We maybe can use some form of positive votes, lets say each world can have bages people willingly can click. For uniqueness, for optimization, dedication or something... And only for rank trusted. \n\nUsing ai to create assets takes far more effort than just downloading free/ripped rooms and posting em as a \"new word\".  I'd rather see rule tht punishes pushing their \"No Ai\" banners. So  \"Yes, Ai, who cares\" if its good so question of quality yea.\n\nWe have hundreds of same rooms...\n\n Editing some light and adding coffee machine does not make same room any unique.. We kinda need easier way to report those with just \"Copy of [world link]\".",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
